<title>BELARUS: Belarussian rouble flat at 14,650 to dlr in Minsk.</title>
<headline>Belarussian rouble flat at 14,650 to dlr in Minsk.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble was unchanged at 14,650 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>				    September 30	  September 27</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    14,650		  14,650</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $5.037 mln	    $3.645 mln</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
